                         "originalText":  "[EMBED 1] = one nested object inside its parent document\n[EMBED N] = embedded array owned by its parent document\n[REF] = ObjectId reference to a shared collection\nREF 1:N / N:N = reference cardinality between collections\n\nINGREDIENT_NUTRIENT  â†’ ingredients.nutrients[]\nRECIPE_INGREDIENT     â†’ dishes.recipe[]\nCOOKING_STEP / SUB_STEP â†’ dishes.cookingSteps[].subSteps[]\nORDER_ITEM â†’ orders.items[] (discriminator: itemType)\nWEEKLY_MEAL_SELECTION â†’ packageItem.weeks[].selections[]",
