                         "updated":  1787551168931,
                         "link":  null,
                         "locked":  false,
                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "fontSize":  14,
                         "originalText":  "1. One restriction collection handles dietary rules, allergies, and health conditions.\n2. Restriction matching checks direct ingredients, ingredient groups, compound components, and nutrient thresholds.\n3. A la carte is one price calculation per line; package groups weeks, dishes, and multiple deliveries.\n4. References point to shared catalogs; snapshots protect historical order values.\n5. Dashed optional collections can be split out when payments or fulfillment become large/high-write.",
                         "lineHeight":  1.3,
                         "text":  "1. One restriction collection handles dietary rules, allergies, and health conditions.\n2. Restriction matching checks direct ingredients, ingredient groups, compound components, and nutrient thresholds.\n3. A la carte is one price calculation per line; package groups weeks, dishes, and multiple deliveries.\n4. References point to shared catalogs; snapshots protect historical order values.\n5. Dashed optional collections can be split out when payments or fulfillment become large/high-write.",
